$.d32=A.a(["Hey, are we still on for lunch today?","Yes! Does 12:30 work for you?","12:30 is perfect. I'll meet you at the cafe.","Great! I'm starving already.","Same here, see you soon!","Actually, can we push it to 1:00? Something came up.","No problem at all. 1:00 it is.","Thanks for being flexible!","Of course. Text me when you're on your way.","Will do!","Just leaving now. ETA 10 mins.","Okay, I'll order my coffee and grab a table.","Get me my usual if you can?","You got it. Latte with oat milk, right?","Yes, thank you! You're a lifesaver.","Almost here?","Just parking the car now!","Cool, I see a good spot in the back.","Perfect. I see you!","Waving! Over here.","This place is packed today.","I know, glad you found a table.","So, what's your big news?","Right! I got the job!","Shut up! No way! Congratulations!","I'm so excited! I start next month.","That's amazing! We have to celebrate.","This coffee is my celebration for now.","We should do something bigger this weekend.","I'm down! What did you have in mind?","Dinner downtown? My treat.","You don't have to do that!","I want to! It's a big deal.","Okay, that sounds wonderful. Thank you!","So tell me all about the interview.","It went better than I ever expected.","I knew you would nail it.","Thanks for believing in me!","Always. So proud of you.","Means a lot. Really.","What else is new?","Not much. Just the usual chaos.","How's your family doing?","They're good! My sister is visiting soon.","Oh fun! When does she get in?","Next Friday. I'm so excited.","You'll have a blast. How long is she staying?","A whole week!","That's awesome. We should all hang out.","She would love that. I'll set it up."],t.s)
